to as stimulus.

00:04:05.911 --> 00:04:08.247
-One of the things that's
making me really frustrated

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:12.284
right now is when I hear people
talk about this as stimulus.

00:04:12.284 --> 00:04:13.919
Let's be clear.

00:04:13.919 --> 00:04:16.789
It is not stimulus money
to give people money

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:18.758
so they can feed themselves.

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:21.027
So, that they can keep heat on
in the winter.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:22.795
So that they can avoid eviction.

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:25.932
That's not stimulus,
that is basic needs

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:28.868
that we're talking about meeting
and you are absolutely right,

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:31.771
that it's not enough to just do
some unemployment,

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.139
it's not enough to
do more with food assistance,

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:36.174
people need that
direct assistance.

00:04:36.174 --> 00:04:37.376
And she is right, too.

00:04:37.376 --> 00:04:39.278
All that was missing was
a "that's crap,"

00:04:39.278 --> 00:04:41.180
or, you know,
a few other swears.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.916
Next time she should feel free
to say one of the many things

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.518
that makes me really upset at
these [bleep] gibrones is

00:04:46.518 --> 00:04:49.021
when I hear their bitch mouths
talk about a stimulus.

00:04:49.021 --> 00:04:51.657
It's not stimulus, it's money
for people to eat and pay for

00:04:51.657 --> 00:04:53.125
